                "text": "I'm working with my Democratic colleagues to prevent a Republican Health Care Crisis. Illinois households this year are paying an average of $260 a month for coverage through the Affordable Care Act. Next year, if the ACA tax credits expire, that average monthly rate will jump to $464.\n \nYou can shop for ACA health plans and see if this impacts you at https://t.co/fGgC3HN97y.",
